                    "message": "It's been a while since we had these discussions.  I remember agreeing to a generalization, but I thought it was more general than \"CPERFile\", as not all crash dumps will be CPER files.\n\nHowever, if this is direction the community prefers, I'm fine with it and can override with a downstream patch for now."
